\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4981956 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Be inclusive with your thinking.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Don't try to eliminate ideas too quickly.
\par Build on your ideas and see how many different research projects you can identify.
\par Try and be creative.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Write down your ideas.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 This will allow you to revisit an idea later on.
\par Or, you can modify and change an idea.
\par write your ideas they tend to be in a continual state of change
\par Good feeling to sit down and scan the many ideas
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Try not to be overly influenced at this time by what you feel others expect from you }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 (your
\par colleagues, your profession, your academic department, etc.).
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 
You have a much better chance of selecting a topic that will be really of interest to you if it is your
\par topic. .
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Don't begin your thinking by assuming that your research will draw international attention to you!!
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Instead, be realistic in setting your goal.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af41\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f41\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 \bullet  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid4981956\charrsid4929842 Make sure your expectations are tempered by:
