Qualities Of A Good Market Report
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 A person writing a M}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 arket Report should have a comprehensive knowledge of the matter that has

\par to be reported. He must always keep in mind the following points.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 1. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 
Normally a Market Report is not personal. It should be written using third person and the past
\par tense.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 2. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 It should be easy so that }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 general readers can }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977  understand the technical terms used in the report.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 3}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 . }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 There should be a good analysis of changes of prices and demand and supply relationship.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 4}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 . }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 Words should be used economically. Unnecessary details must be avoided. It should not be so
\par short that misses the essential information.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 5. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 Market Report should be based upon the facts. Events should be wri}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977 tten in the minute details. Any }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid2702977\charrsid2702977 
writer of Market Report should be unbiased while concluding his report.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid1319977\charrsid2702977 
