\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid13990043 Ans:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13990043 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid13990043\charrsid3895221 Presentation
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid13990043\charrsid3895221 This action of communication in which one speaker is doing most of the sending and a number of
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid13990043 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid13990043\charrsid3895221 listeners are doing most of the receiving is known as oral presentation

\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3895221 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af40\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f40\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid3895221 Extemporaneous of oral presentation
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid3895221\charrsid3895221 
In this method the delivery is very carefully planned and practiced and speaker, makes a presentation with the help of an outline, note cards, or visual aid. It is very popular and effective method of delivering a speech. In this way the speaker can glanc
e
 at his notes, keep eye contact and speak in a natural, conversational tone. Reading In this method the whole presentation is read aloud. It helps a speaker when the presentation has technical or complex topic. If you choose to read your speech, practice 
enough so that you can still have eye contact with your audience, otherwise, your speech may become boring.
\par For reading, some speakers use a page style similar to a TV script, leaving a left margin of about one-third of the page. In that wide margin are pronunciation aids or suggestions as to where to look in an audience.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f39\fs22\cf2\ulc0\insrsid13990043\charrsid3895221 
